☐ do not add real-money Star purchases yet
    Wait until earned/spent Stars prove useful and wallet operations are stable.

☐ do not add public Star status, account strength scores, or leaderboards
    Stars are private credits, not public reputation.

☐ do not make free flows worse to make Star spending attractive
    Core Muze features must stay useful for free users.

